  "body": "The explainer for this feature is here: https://github.com/mfreed7/declarative-shadow-dom/blob/master/README.md\nThe issue discussion is here: https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/831\nThere is a corresponding [Pull Request](https://github.com/whatwg/dom/pull/892) for the DOM spec that goes along with this PR.\n\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * Chromium: [Implemented and shipped](https://chromestatus.com/feature/5161240576393216).\n   * WebKit: [supportive](https://github.com/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/12)\n   * Gecko: [supportive](https://github.com/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/335)\n\n- [X] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * In WPT: https://wpt.fyi/results/shadow-dom/declarative?label=master&label=experimental&aligned&q=declarative\n   * More tests are being implemented, but the basics are there.\n\n- [X] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/master/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Chrome: https://crbug.com/1042130\n   * Firefox: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1712140\n   * Safari: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=245556\n\nCloses https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/7069\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5465/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 29, 2023, 7:30 PM UTC (e9eccef)\">/acknowledgements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5465/3ca0811...e9eccef/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 29, 2023, 7:30 PM UTC (e9eccef)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5465/document-lifecycle.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 29, 2023, 7:30 PM UTC (e9eccef)\">/document-lifecycle.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5465/3ca0811...e9eccef/document-lifecycle.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 29, 2023, 7:30 PM UTC (e9eccef)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5465/document-sequences.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 29, 2023, 7:30 PM UTC (e9eccef)\">/document-sequences.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5465/3ca0811...e9eccef/document-sequences.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 29, 2023, 7:30 PM UTC (e9eccef)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5465/dynamic-markup-insertion.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 29, 2023, 7:30 PM UTC (e9eccef)\">/dynamic-markup-insertion.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5465/3ca0811...e9eccef/dynamic-markup-insertion.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 29, 2023, 7:30 PM UTC (e9eccef)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5465/indices.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 29, 2023, 7:30 PM UTC (e9eccef)\">/indices.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5465/3ca0811...e9eccef/indices.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 29, 2023, 7:30 PM UTC (e9eccef)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5465/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 29, 2023, 7:30 PM UTC (e9eccef)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5465/3ca0811...e9eccef/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 29, 2023, 7:30 PM UTC (e9eccef)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5465/parsing.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 29, 2023, 7:30 PM UTC (e9eccef)\">/parsing.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5465/3ca0811...e9eccef/parsing.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 29, 2023, 7:30 PM UTC (e9eccef)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5465/scripting.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 29, 2023, 7:3